<title>USA: Meredith names Kerr as chief executive.</title>
<headline>Meredith names Kerr as chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES, Iowa 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meredith Corp said Monday it has appointed its president and chief operating officer William Kerr to serve as the company's chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Kerr replaces Jack Rehm, who will remain as chairman of the board.</p>
<p>Kerr will take over as chief executive on January 1, Meredith said.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
